        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    annual_duration = 7.020\n    annual_convexity = 65.180\n    yield_change = -25 / 10000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    price_change_duration = -annual_duration * yield_change * 100\n    convexity_adjustment = annual_convexity * 100 * yield_change ** 2\n    anticipated_price_change = price_change_duration + (0.5 * convexity_adjustment)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(anticipated_price_change, 3)\n```",
